<title>JAPAN: Dia Kensetsu -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Dia Kensetsu -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 95.29		vs	   88.19</p>
<p> Operating	    5.22		vs	    6.85</p>
<p> Current	    648    million	  vs	  718    million</p>
<p> Net		  422    million	  vs	  515    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.73 yen	  vs	    9.44 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     55 million	  vs	  55 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Dia Kensetsu Co Ltd builds and markets condominiums.</p>
</text>
